Updated support for blocks-based content to be compatible with the evolving support for the Plate editor in Aurora and volto-plate. Plate regions (stored with the `plate` block type and keyed by region name) are handled in the block visitor, the `SearchableText` indexer, and link integrity checks. The legacy `__somersault__` block type is deprecated. Add-ons can check for the new `plonerestapi-plate-regions` ZCML feature. @sneridagh
